"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, Spartanburg County has 75 years of rain on record for its 7 grids, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, September to October and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of those years. In 2025 the middle got 61% of normal in October to November and 36% in November to December. So far in 2026 it has 42% of normal in March to April.</p>"}
